-- The Bride (Kill Bill) · a character card in the style of a board-game deck.
-- Every shape on this card is drawn here in words. Fan concept, not for sale.

create a card called the-bride-closeup from stainless, seed 1973.

-- ── the katana: built along its own line, guard at 0 0, blade pointing right ──
define a katana with $size 600 as:
  draw a shape called blade from 0 $size * -0.015 to $size * 0.3 $size * -0.025 to $size * 0.55 $size * -0.036 to $size * 0.8 $size * -0.052 to $size * 0.56 $size * -0.01 to $size * 0.3 $size * 0.003 to 0 $size * 0.015.
  draw a line called hamon from $size * 0.03 $size * -0.004 to $size * 0.3 $size * -0.013 to $size * 0.55 $size * -0.024 to $size * 0.74 $size * -0.04, $size * 0.004 wide.
  draw an ellipse called guard, $size * 0.04 by $size * 0.13, at $size * -0.013 0.
  draw a rectangle called grip, $size * 0.26 by $size * 0.048, corners $size * 0.01, at $size * -0.167 0.
  draw a rectangle called wrap, $size * 0.026 by $size * 0.026, at $size * -0.277 0.
  turn the wrap 45 degrees in place.
  copy the wrap 6 times, $size * 0.043 apart.
  draw a circle called pommel, $size * 0.024 big, at $size * -0.31 0.
end.

-- ── frame, title and cost badges ─────────────────────────────────────────────
draw a rectangle called frame, 1046 by 1635, corners 40, hollow, 34 wide.
draw a rectangle called keyline, 984 by 1573, corners 36, hollow, 3 wide.
write "The Bride" called title in Mr Dafoe, at 380 250, size 124.

draw a circle called badge-red, 46 big, at 900 214.
draw a circle called badge-black, 46 big, at 1010 214.
place a katana called badge-sword at 886 228, size 82, turned -45.
draw a star called badge-splat, 9 points, 30 big, 13 inner, at 1010 214.

-- ── the art window: plain yellow, kept clear for a picture (print @bride.jpg in the art.) ──
make the window 800 by 800, at 220 370.
draw a rectangle called art, 900 by 800, at 620 770.

-- ── the ability band ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
draw a rectangle called band, 1080 by 214, at 620 1300.
write "Strike first. Gain 5 blades." called rule-1 in Jost 500, at 620 1282, size 50.
write "Cross one name off your list." called rule-2 in Jost 500, at 620 1352, size 50.

-- ── the stats row: tiers, numbers and blade pips ─────────────────────────────
draw a line called rule-line from 150 1462 to 1090 1462, 3 wide.
draw a line called divider-1 from 446 1488 to 446 1648, 3 wide.
draw a line called divider-2 from 794 1488 to 794 1648, 3 wide.

draw a circle called tier-1, 8 big, at 290 1512.
draw a circle called tier-2, 8 big, at 608 1512.
copy the tier-2 2 times, 24 apart.
draw a circle called tier-3, 8 big, at 932 1512.
copy the tier-3 3 times, 24 apart.

write "1" called stat-1 in Big Shoulders Display 800, at 262 1622, size 104.
write "2" called stat-2 in Big Shoulders Display 800, at 594 1622, size 104.
write "5" called stat-3 in Big Shoulders Display 800, at 932 1622, size 104.
draw a star called pip, 5 points, 24 big, 10 inner, at 330 1586.
copy the pip, by 336 0, called pip-2.
copy the pip, by 674 0, called pip-3.

write "CONCEPT · NOT FOR SALE" called notice in Martian Mono, at 620 1700, size 22.

-- ── the back: yellow and red squares, a cream panel, the sword ──────────────
draw a rectangle called squares, 40 by 40, at 100 100.
copy the squares 14 times, 80 apart.
copy the squares 21 times, 80 apart, down.
copy the squares, by 40 40, called squares-2.
draw a rectangle called panel, 700 by 900, corners 30, at 620 860.
write "Kill Bill" called back-title in Mr Dafoe, at 620 560, size 150.
write "VOL. 1" called back-vol in Big Shoulders Display 800, at 620 650, size 56.
place a katana called back-sword at 434 1580, size 760.

-- ── making it ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
on the front.
enamel the card in cream.
enamel the frame in crimson.
enamel the keyline in crimson.
enamel the rule-line and the divider-1 and the divider-2 in grey.

enamel the title in crimson.
enamel the badge-red in crimson.
enamel the badge-black in yellow.
plate the badge-sword with chrome.
enamel the badge-splat in red.

enamel the art in yellow.
print @bride-closeup.jpg in the window, focused at 0.5 0.4.

enamel the band in yellow.
enamel the rule-1 and the rule-2 in crimson.

enamel the tier-1 and the tier-2 and the tier-3 in crimson.
enamel the stat-1 and the stat-2 and the stat-3 in crimson.
enamel the pip and the pip-2 and the pip-3 in crimson.
enamel the notice in grey.

on the back.
enamel the card in yellow.
enamel the squares in red.
enamel the squares-2 in black.
outline the panel in black, 6 wide.
enamel the panel in cream.
enamel the frame in crimson.
enamel the back-title in black.
enamel the back-vol in crimson.
outline the back-sword in black, 5 wide.
plate the back-sword-blade with chrome.
etch the back-sword-hamon.
enamel the back-sword-grip in black.
plate the back-sword-guard and the back-sword-wrap and the back-sword-pommel with gold.
